---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact | FormFix India" description="Contact FormFix India. No contact address is listed on this page yet.">
<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Contact</h1>
<p class="text-slate-600 mt-2 max-w-2xl">If you have a correction, a tool problem, or a privacy question, this page lists what to write about. A contact channel is not published here yet.</p>
<div class="space-y-4 mt-6">
  <article class="card p-5 md:p-6"><p class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">✉️</p><h2 class="font-bold text-lg mt-2">What to write about</h2><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed list-disc ml-5"><li>Corrections to requirement profiles</li><li>Tool problems</li><li>Privacy questions</li></ul></article>
  <article class="card p-5 md:p-6"><p class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">⚠️</p><h2 class="font-bold text-lg mt-2">No address yet</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">No email address is listed here. A listed address that is not monitored would send your message nowhere.</p></article>
</div>
</Base>
